# ============================================================
# ai-video-studio —— 入库排除规则
# 原则：只排除「本机产物」和「体积大的素材」，
#       文档、脚本、提示词、实验记录一律入库。
# ============================================================

# --- 编辑器 / 操作系统 ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# --- 运行期临时产物 ---
*.log
*.pid
.tmp/
*.bak
*~

# --- 模型权重与生成素材（体积大，用脚本现拉现下，不入库）---
# 目录占位符 .gitkeep 不受影响（扩展名不匹配）
assets/**/*.mp4
assets/**/*.mov
assets/**/*.mkv
assets/**/*.avi
assets/**/*.png
assets/**/*.jpg
assets/**/*.jpeg
assets/**/*.webp
assets/**/*.wav
assets/**/*.mp3
assets/**/*.flac
assets/**/*.safetensors
assets/**/*.gguf
assets/**/*.ckpt

# --- 本地凭据（绝不入库）---
*.key
*.pem
.secret*
credentials*.json
